   "AdvertisingActivity_3610610_ContentText": "Invite your former companions back and complete tasks together to receive Astrites, Shell Credits, and more! Returning Rovers who link their accounts will also receive bonus gifts!",
   "AdvertisingActivity_3610610_SubTitle": "Back to Solaris",
   "AdvertisingActivity_3610610_ThumbnailText": "Back to Solaris",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710601_ContentText": "Welcome to Second Solaris School! A brand-new school-life simulation entry in the Second Coming of Solaris series has officially launched!\n\nAs the train slowly pulls into the station, the platform announcement guides \"you,\" the protagonist of the story, back from a distant land to the small town where you spent your childhood. Over the course of a year at school, plan your schedule, build your skills, share everyday laughs with your friends in school, and face the challenges of growing up together as you prepare for the final evaluation and write your own Story Ending...",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710601_SubTitle": "Second Coming of Solaris: Unwritten Dreams",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710601_ThumbnailText": "Second Coming of Solaris: Unwritten Dreams",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710602_ContentText": "A newly emerged gateway leads to an uncharted region of the Somnoire. The Ivory Gatekeeper asks you to explore this place, which it calls the \"Desolate Dreamfield,\" and uncover the reason behind the gateway's appearance.",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710602_SubTitle": "Dreamfield Odyssey",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710602_ThumbnailText": "Dreamfield Odyssey",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710603_ContentText": "A huge update just hit \"Lahai-Roi Blocks\"—the long-awaited rotate feature is finally here! And it looks like there are more hidden mechanics in store than meets the eye…",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710603_SubTitle": "Lahai-Roi Blocks: Turnabout",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710603_ThumbnailText": "Lahai-Roi Blocks: Turnabout",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710604_ContentText": "Word has it that Maji of Lollo Logistics is gearing up for a very long journey. Of course, between rounds of prep work, he hasn't forgotten his old friends, and has put together a brand-new sponsorship event.",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710604_SubTitle": "Lollo Campaign: Groundwork",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3710604_ThumbnailText": "Lollo Campaign: Groundwork",
