   "AdvertisingIntelligence_3610503_ContentText": "WavesLine Theme Bundle: Hsin and Moon\nIncludes WavesLine theme \"Light of Waking Moon\", WavesLine chat background \"Glow of Lanterns\", WavesLine chat bubble \"Rice Cake\", WavesLine decor \"Solicitude of the Heart\", and Astrites.",
   "AdvertisingIntelligence_3610503_SubTitle": "New WavesLine Theme & Accessories",
   "AdvertisingIntelligence_3610503_ThumbnailText": "New WavesLine Theme & Accessories",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710401_ContentText": "Lune Noire\nHiyuki - Deluxe Outfit\n\nA costume Hiyuki wore while filming a movie with Startorch Academy students.\nHer gaze has lost none of its resolve or compassion, nor her movements their grace. With blade and frost at her command, she remains every bit as dangerous.",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710401_SubTitle": "New Outfit",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710401_ThumbnailText": "New Outfit",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710402_ContentText": "During Version 3.8, you may select one of the 5-Star Resonators available in the Reverb Resonator Convene event as the Convene target. You may change your selection at any point, which does not affect the Guarantee count.\nThe Version 3.8 Reverb Resonator Convene features the following 5-Star Resonators:\nCamellya, Roccia, Phoebe, and Brant",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710402_SubTitle": "Starpath Reverbs II: <word>Reverb Resonator Convene</word>",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710402_ThumbnailText": "Starpath Reverbs II: Reverb Resonator Convene",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710403_ContentText": "During Version 3.8, you may select one of the 5-Star Weapons available in the Reverb Weapon Convene event as the Convene target. You may change your selection at any point, which does not affect the Guarantee count.\nThe Version 3.8 Reverb Weapon Convene features the following 5-Star Weapons:\nRed Spring, Tragicomedy, Luminous Hymn, and Unflickering Valor",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710403_SubTitle": "Tideforge Reverbs II: <word>Reverb Weapon Convene</word>",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710403_ThumbnailText": "Tideforge Reverbs II: Reverb Weapon Convene",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710404_ContentText": "In the Gifts of Starpath event, Convene in the Reverb Resonator Convene to accumulate Convene attempts and unlock corresponding tier rewards.",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710404_SubTitle": "Gifts of Starpath",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710404_ThumbnailText": "Gifts of Starpath",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710405_ContentText": "Hiyuki- Accessory\nFlaming Sakura\n\n*This Accessory will be removed from the featured content after Version 3.8 and remain available as permanent items purchasable with Astrites. For more details, please stay tuned to the official announcements.",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710405_SubTitle": "New Resonator Accessory",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710405_ThumbnailText": "New Resonator Accessory",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710406_ContentText": "After the event begins, log in to the game daily to claim your daily sign-in rewards.",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710406_SubTitle": "Gifts of Bygone Dreams",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710406_ThumbnailText": "Gifts of Bygone Dreams",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710407_ContentText": "After the event begins, log in to the game daily to claim your daily sign-in rewards.",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710407_SubTitle": "Whither the Wind",
+  "AdvertisingIntelligence_3710407_ThumbnailText": "Whither the Wind",
   "AdvertisingRegion_2810301_ContentText": "A warm, humid haven beneath the Roya Frostlands. Following an ancient polar shift, this region became the new Solaris pole, prompting the Roya to migrate below ground. Here, the Spacetrek Collective established Startorch Academy. Today, this borderless academic city has become a cradle for countless rising scholars.",
