   "AdvertisingStory_3610202_ContentText": "A mysterious girl approaches you on WavesLine, asking for your help to collect the scattered Feeling Capsule shards.",
   "AdvertisingStory_3610202_SubTitle": "Moonlike Heart, Mortal Longing",
   "AdvertisingStory_3610202_ThumbnailText": "Moonlike Heart, Mortal Longing",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3710201_ContentText": "Something strange has happened within the Somnoire. A man from the New Federation is teleported to the Land of Xuanfang through a mysterious door. He claims that the Federated Cities' Resonator War has somehow resurfaced within the Somnoire. To learn more about this buried history and resolve the anomaly, you decide to investigate. Venturing deeper into the Somnoire, you discover a train carrying those who perished in the Resonator War, bound for the depths of dreams...",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3710201_SubTitle": "Chapter IV Act V - <word>A Bouquet for Tomorrow</word>",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3710201_ThumbnailText": "A Bouquet for Tomorrow",
   "AdvertisingStory_TaleQuest_Title": "New Tales Quest",
   "AdvertisingSystem_2810701_ContentText": "As you explore Lahai-Roi, a new Expedition Motorbike Utility will be available\n\nThe expedition motorbike helps you move faster. Its functionalities improve through upgrades.\n\nWhen on the expedition motorbike, use features such as acceleration, Boost, Drift, and Bounce Jump etc. While moving, a force field is deployed around the expedition motorbike, and the Resonator will be forced to dismount once the force field is down.\n\nThe motorbike is equipped with the Adaptive Hook module, which can be used to grab resources, Sonance Caskets, and other items over long distances.  \n\nThe motorbike is able to receive the Heart Radio Channel, allowing you to tune in and enjoy your favorite music while on the road.\n\nNumerous Challenge Tracks can be found in Lahai-Roi for you to take on with the motorbike.",
   "AdvertisingSystem_2810701_SubTitle": "Expedition Motorbike",
@@ -7397,6 +7439,18 @@
   "AdvertisingSystem_3610705_ContentText": "Tiered Client Resource Downloads will be available for the PC, iOS, and Android versions of the game. The PC version supports downloads in three resource tiers: UHD, HD, and SD, while the mobile versions support two: HD and SD. The resource package size and graphics quality vary by tier. You can choose the tier that best suits your device specifications and needs.\n\n*As this optimization involves significant changes to the game client, Tiered Client Resource Downloads will initially be launched as a limited test. As we gradually roll out the test, the dev team will closely monitor your feedback and continue to optimize the feature. Stay tuned for more information on this feature.",
   "AdvertisingSystem_3610705_SubTitle": "Tiered Client Resource Downloads",
   "AdvertisingSystem_3610705_ThumbnailText": "Tiered Client Resource Downloads",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3710701_ContentText": "In Version 3.8, Rover's Resonance Conversion page is overhauled, featuring a new, more streamlined UI.\n\nAfter Rover's Resonance Attribute is converted, the equipped Echo set will be automatically switched to the one for the corresponding Resonance Attribute.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3710701_SubTitle": "Rover's Resonance Conversion Optimization",
