+  "AdvertisingSystem_3710702_ContentText": "In Version 3.8, a new Overview page is added to the Resonator Ascension Planner, allowing you to view your Resonators' development status at a glance.\n\nA beta version of the Recommended Lineup feature is also available on this page, offering team-building suggestions and alternative lineup options for your Resonators.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3710702_SubTitle": "Resonator Ascension Planner Optimization",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3710702_ThumbnailText": "Resonator Ascension Planner Optimization",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3710703_ContentText": "In Version 3.8, a Material Locator button is added to the Material Collection page of Guidebook and the Resonator Ascension Planner, allowing you to locate unlocked challenges that drop the required materials.\n\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Click Gamepad=Press} the button to locate the corresponding material collection challenge on the map.",
