   "HelpText_418_Title": "Back to Solaris",
   "HelpText_419_Content": "[About]\nTo encourage the Pioneers to further share their Lahai-Roi explorations, Lollo Logistics has partnered with the Pioneer Association to proudly present the campaign: Beyond the Waves! Participate and upload your Adventure Logs to the Lollo courier truck to get various rewards!\n\n[Eligibility]\nReach Union Level 14 and activate the Resonance Nexus in Startorch Academy during the Main Quest \"What Burns Beneath Frostlands\" to unlock\n\n[Event Rules]\nDuring the event, you can complete event tasks once per day to obtain a set number of Adventure Logs.\nEach Adventure Log can be exchanged for an Adventure Package; Adventure Packages contain special mechanics that, when triggered, unlock a large amount of rewards.\nThere are 3 Inventories for the Adventure Packages. Once you collect all deliveries in an Inventory, the next Inventory will be unlocked.",
   "HelpText_419_Title": "Beyond the Waves: Lahai-Roi",
-  "HelpText_41_Content": "[Equip Echoes]\nEquip Echo to gain attributes, Echo Skills, and specific bonuses.\nDrag and drop for faster equipping.\n\n[COST]\nThe number of Echoes you can equip is limited by the total COST. The COST of equipped Echoes cannot exceed your current COST limit. \nCollect Echoes of new types to upgrade your Data Bank level and increase the COST limit.\n\n[Echo Skills]\nThe Echo assembled in the main Echo position (first position) can activate the corresponding Echo skills. Switch the \"Summary\" button to view the detailed and brief descriptions of Echo skills.\nWhen Echo skills are in use, the corresponding main Echo cannot be replaced or unloaded temporarily.\n\n[Sonata Effects]\nEvery Echo comes with its own \"Sonata.\" When the number of Echo assembled with the same Sonata reaches 2 or 5, the corresponding Sonata Effect can be activated.\nMultiple Echo with the same Sonata and the same name equipped will only count towards the Sonata Effect once.\nEcho with the same name may carry different Sonata due to data differences.",
+  "HelpText_41_Content": "[Equip Echoes]\nEquip Echoes to gain attributes, Echo Skills, and specific bonuses.\nDrag and drop for faster equipping.\n\n[COST]\nThe number of Echoes you can equip is limited by the total COST. The COST of equipped Echoes cannot exceed your current COST limit. \nCollect Echoes of new types to upgrade your Data Bank level and increase the COST limit.\n\n[Echo Skills]\nThe Echo equipped in the main Echo position (first position) can activate the corresponding Echo skills. Switch the \"Summary\" button to view the detailed and brief descriptions of Echo skills.\nWhen Echo skills are in use, the corresponding main Echo cannot be replaced or unloaded temporarily.\n\n[Sonata Effects]\nEvery Echo comes with its own \"Sonata.\" When the number of Echoes equipped with the same Sonata reaches 2 or 5, the corresponding Sonata Effect can be activated.\nMultiple Echoes with the same Sonata and the same name equipped will only count towards the Sonata Effect once.\nEchoes with the same name may carry different Sonata due to data differences.",
   "HelpText_41_Title": "Echo System",
   "HelpText_420_Content": "[About] \nGreen and hazy as they may feel, school days always shine like gems in the river of memory. Those stories drift among the stars, your constant companions through every quiet night. \nAs the New Solar Celebration unfolds, fresh little tales begin to blossom between you and your friends...  \n\n[Eligibility] \nSolve the first riddle with Sigrika in Main Quest \"Gold Suspended in Shadows\" to unlock\n\n[Rules] \nProgress the Main Quest to unlock the events of the corresponding Resonators. Certain conditions are required to unlock some of the events. Complete \"Whispers Between Stars\" to earn exclusive rewards, including Astrites and a Livery.",
   "HelpText_420_Title": "Whispers Between Stars",
@@ -108362,10 +108417,10 @@
   "ItemInfo_80001090_BgDescription": "Made with fresh live fish from the Luo River, this dish is gently poached over a low flame and dressed in a traditional sweet-and-sour sauce. It gleams a glossy red, its flesh silver-white at every cut—delicate on the tongue, with a bright tangy-sweetness. The recipe is an old one, and though no shortage of variations have appeared over the years, only the original may be called \"Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar.\"\nAt the Waking Moon Festival in Yuan Fortress long ago, Qingxiao once tasted this dish at the famed restaurant Yuan's Flavors. Lanterns filled the city that night; dragons and fishes of light danced above the crowds, and every face wore a smile. A century later, fewer and fewer can cook it the way it tasted back then. Qingxiao has tried her own hand at it, but never managed to bring back the taste she remembers.",
   "ItemInfo_80001090_Name": "Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar",
   "ItemInfo_80001090_ObtainedShowDescription": "Increases Energy Regen of all Resonators in the team by 34% for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
-  "ItemInfo_80001091_AttributesDescription": "Increases ATK of all Resonators in the team by 28% for 30 min. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
+  "ItemInfo_80001091_AttributesDescription": "Increases ATK of all Resonators in the team by 28% for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
   "ItemInfo_80001091_BgDescription": "This snow-white steamed rice cake is round as a full moon, soft and springy, and scattered with candied green and red threads like twin rainbows fallen across snow. Hence the name \"Moonlit Splendor.\" Lightly sweet and dense on the tongue, the fragrance of rice and sugar from it melts slowly between the teeth.\nThis confection is created by the wife of Jingran's Shifu, Granny Yanshu, and is his favorite. His little sister always says the cake is sickly sweet. Jingran disagrees, and every time he cups one in his hands and bites down, the satisfaction shows in his whole face.",
   "ItemInfo_80001091_Name": "Moonlit Splendor",
-  "ItemInfo_80001091_ObtainedShowDescription": "Increases ATK of all Resonators in the team by 28% for 30 min. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
+  "ItemInfo_80001091_ObtainedShowDescription": "Increases ATK of all Resonators in the team by 28% for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
   "ItemInfo_80001095_AttributesDescription": "Grants 44% Heavy Attack DMG Bonus to all Resonators in the team for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
   "ItemInfo_80001095_BgDescription": "When Suoming first arrived at Xuanfang Hold, she came across a dish flavored with tea broth called \"Memories of Autumn,\" which awakened memories of the white tea from home. It was Tangning who later told her that this dish originally used no tea at all, but due to the lack of its true ingredients locally, it was a traveling soul yearning for the taste who used tea as a substitute, thus giving it its present form.\nSuoming then procured Huating white tea and personally remade the dish. The tea's fresh aroma gave it a delicate flavor, and from then on it frequently graced her table. Those under her command secretly lamented that her homesickness was difficult to dispel, which accounted for her singular fondness for the flavor. Yet to her, it was merely a preference for that fresh and clear taste, and perhaps, without intention, this dish had also retained within it the flavor of her homeland.",
   "ItemInfo_80001095_Name": "Huating Memories",
@@ -203381,7 +203436,7 @@
   "MusicDes_250000023_Text": "Happy birthday, Denia!",
   "MusicDes_250000024_Text": "Begin again, it's all the same.",
   "MusicDes_250000025_Text": "Every sign is lining up. Like it's calling me to you.",
-  "MusicDes_250000026_Text": "毕业快乐。向着远方……飞吧。",
